# 覆盖全局 gitignore 的 *.dll 规则:
# MsExtensionsAI 第三方运行库需要随仓库分发,否则拉取后 Unity 引用全部断开。
!Assets/CBIM/ThirdParty/MsExtensionsAI/*.dll

# Native-.NET migration: src/ tree must be tracked despite parent *.csproj rule
!src/**/*.csproj
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!nuget.config
!cbim-native.sln
!global.json

# Build artefacts under src/
src/**/bin/
src/**/obj/
